#~ "한쪽의 시간만 낭비하는 일방적인 경기. 11–0 “피클”이 대표적인 예입니다."

#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:1120
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A tight club gives the best floor — random dealing manages 61% quality "
#~ "there against 45% in a varied club — at some cost in ranking accuracy, "
#~ "since players who are genuinely close are hard to order. But controlling "
#~ "the roster does not control the matchups: dealt randomly, that same club "
