#: src/components/organisms/MatchmakingReport.re.mjs:718
#~ msgid ""
#~ "A tight club here means everyone within about 0.68 DUPR points, most of "
#~ "the pack inside 0.4 — and it is where matchmaking should matter least. "
#~ "For the opening rounds it is: with everyone close, any way of dealing the "
